&lt;p&gt;Albumentations is cited by &lt;strong&gt;563 unique life-sciences / biomedical-imaging papers&lt;/strong&gt;. The count is filtered from an internal citation export containing 2,470 unique citing papers and 12,371 author-paper-affiliation rows.&lt;/p&gt;

